  "instructions": [
    {
      "type": "step",
      "text": "knead 10 minutes, rest 1-2 hours\n197g dough balls OR 98g\nrest 1-2hrs\ndust with 10g semolina mixed with 50g ap flour\nbake 350F (higher?)~15 minutes + steam"
    },
    {
      "type": "step",
      "text": "POOLISH + AUTOLYSE\nmix together bread flour, dry milk, sugar, nutritional yeast, oil, and water\nlet rest 30 minutes\nthen, add some water to dough (for salt and yeast)\nadd salt and yeast\ncombine with wet hand until yeast and salt evenly distributed throughout\nrest 30 minutes\n1st strength building fold\nrest 30 minutes\n2nd strength building fold\nPut in fridge overnight (at least 4 hours) if putting in fridge\nif not, let sit out 1-2 hours ish"
